 r←Test_OptionsTool_002(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;parms;globalParms
⍝ Exercise "OptionsTools" with just the default.
⍝ Exception: when "autoPress" is not ¯1.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 globalParms←#._APLGUI.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'

 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.OptionsTool.CreateParms
 parms.timeout←0.1
 parms.default←0 1 0
 →FailsIf(1(3↑0 1))≢globalParms parms #._APLGUI.GUI.OptionsTool.Run⍕¨1000000+⍳3
 →FailsIf(1(3↑0 1))≢parms globalParms #._APLGUI.GUI.OptionsTool.Run⍕¨1000000+⍳3

 r←∆OK
